     `uvm_field_int(vtype.vsew, UVM_DEFAULT)
     `uvm_field_int(vtype.vlmul, UVM_DEFAULT)
+    `uvm_field_int(vtype.fractional_lmul, UVM_DEFAULT)
+    `uvm_field_queue_int(legal_eew, UVM_DEFAULT)
